  "content": "\n\n<div><hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">修正了 Superb Warfare 與 Valkyrien Skies 之間的命中判定問題。</h3>\n<br><br>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/mod_loader-forge-ffe8e9?style=for-the-badge&labelColor=ffced2\" alt=\"模組載入器\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/environment-client_|_server-ffe8e9?style=for-the-badge&labelColor=ffced2\" alt=\"模組載入器\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/kawaiicakes/SuperbVS/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/kawaiicakes/SuperbVS?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&labelColor=ffe8e9&color=ffced2\" alt=\"錯誤回報\"></a> <br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/superbvs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1288304?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&labelColor=ffceea&color=ffe8f5\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fsuperbvs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/foPG2Wmv?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&labelColor=ffceea&color=ffe8f5\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a></p>\n<hr></div>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\">我的模組將不再於 CurseForge 上發布更新！請前往 </span></strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\"><strong><a style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fkawaiicakes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth 查看。</a></strong></span></span></h1>\n<h1>📖 資訊</h1>\n<p>此模組修正了 Superb Warfare 與 Valkyrien Skies 2 之間的命中判定問題。我將會（希望如此）積極維護此模組，並在需要時新增更多修復。總之，建議搭配此模組使用最新版的 Superb。較新的版本似乎已加入改善對船隻方塊破壞計算的修復。</p>\n<h1>📝 開發中功能</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>修正來自標槍或艦炮等武器的方塊破壞/穿透計算（1.1.0-beta）</li>\n<li>若/當 Valkyrien Skies 2 推出 1.21 版時，將提供 Neoforge 版本</li>\n</ul>",
